1. e4 c5 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. g3 g6 4. Bg2 Bg7 5. d3 e5 6. Nh3 Nge7 7. O-O O-O 8. f4 d6 9. f5 gxf5 10. exf5 Bxf5 11. Rxf5 Nxf5 12. Be4 Nfe7?? {A big mistake, allowing White to decide the game by a nice combination. Correct was 12...d7.} {[%tqu "En","Black's last move looks reasonable, but in fact it's a very bad slip. How to punish Black for it?","Black is intending to play 13...Ng6, consolidating the position of his king. You should play energetically not to allow Black any time for defence.","Sacrifice your bishop to develop the decisive attack on the enemy king!","e4h7","This efficient blow spells a quick end for Black.",5]} 13. Bxh7+! {[%csl Rf7,Rg8,Rh7][%cal Gd1h5,Gh3g5] A very powerful strike! Now White's attack is irresistible.} Kxh7 ({Or} 13... Kh8 14. Qh5 {winning.}) 14. Qh5+ ({Of course, not} 14. Ng5+? Kg6 15. Qg4 f5 16. Qh4 Rh8 {, and Black is winning.}) 14... Kg8 15. Ng5 Re8 16. Qxf7+ Kh8 17. Qh5+ Kg8 18. Qh7+ Kf8 19. Ne6+ {Winning the queen and depriving the opponent of last illusions.} Kf7 20. Nxd8+ Raxd8 21. Bh6 Nd4 22. Rf1+ Ke6 23. Bxg7 1-0

